  "title": "Slow Cooker Southern Lima Beans and Ham",
  "description": "Dry baby lima beans soak overnight before simmering for hours in the slow cooker with a ham bone and Cajun seasoning. Serve this budget-friendly dish with Mexican corn bread and a side salad for a complete meal.",
